      "evidence_id": "E10"
     },
     {
      "text": "39%",
      "value": 0.3882,
      "evidence_id": "E12"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "A 14-day field-wide shut-in from 2019-06-03 showed only a 3% rate change across it, consistent with it not causing the later speedup.",
    "detail": "Shut-in 2019-06-03 to 2019-06-16, 14 days. P-1 rate_before 290.82 to rate_after 283.19 Sm3/d, relative_change -0.02624. BHP gauge reads 0 since 2018-04-10 (997 days) so pressure trend relies on WHP.",
